	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class will be unsatisfiable. This is because we have given it 2 disjoint parents, which means it could never have any instances (as nothing can be both a CheeseTopping and a VegetableTopping). NB Called ProbeInconsistentTopping in the ProtegeOWL Tutorial."@en ;
