	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A class that is equivalent to the set of individuals that are described in the enumeration - ie Countries can only be either America, England, France, Germany or Italy and nothing else. Note that these individuals have been asserted to be allDifferent from each other."@en ;
