	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If this Entity prov:wasInvalidatedBy Activity :a, then it can qualify how it was invalidated using prov:qualifiedInvalidation [ a prov:Invalidation;  prov:activity :a; :foo :bar ]."@en ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
