	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If this Entity prov:wasQuotedFrom Entity :e, then it can qualify how using prov:qualifiedQuotation [ a prov:Quotation;  prov:entity :e; :foo :bar ]."@en ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> ;
