	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If this Activity prov:wasStartedBy Entity :e1, then it can qualify how it was started using prov:qualifiedStart [ a prov:Start;  prov:entity :e1; :foo :bar ]."@en ;
