	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "If this Activity prov:used Entity :e, then it can qualify how it used it using prov:qualifiedUsage [ a prov:Usage; prov:entity :e; :foo :bar ]."@en ;
	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
