	<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The more specific subproperties of prov:wasDerivedFrom (i.e., prov:wasQuotedFrom, prov:wasRevisionOf, prov:hadPrimarySource) should be used when applicable."@en ;
